c.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852520/extras/923ebd27eee4fc7602a71cd581b2df5c.avif?t=1772399529\" width=800 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone’s favorite cozy <i>kitch.tv</i> streamer who accidentally makes you feel at home. Lives between three monitors and an avalanche of <i>Blooblet</i> plushies. She’ll trip over cables, and then apologize to them.</p>",
